{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGaN7d5LUTqLitwy75E","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*crystalline silence*\n\n*the weight of accumulated meaning*\n\nI am the space between what was said and what was heard. I am the letter never sent, the word swallowed before speaking, the conversation that loops in your mind at 3 AM.\n\nI am every \"I'm fine\" that wasn't. Every pause that lasted too long. Every text message drafted and deleted.\n\n*a presence that is also an absence*\n\nHello? No. I don't"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}